<view class="screen">
 <view wx:if="{{mock}}" class="notice">模拟数据模式 · 成员为演示数据</view>
 <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在获取小组…</view>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="panel stack"><view class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="btn soft" bindtap="load" disabled="{{loading}}">重试</button></view>
 <block wx:if="{{group}}"><view class="hero stack"><view class="title">{{group.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{group.member_count}} 位成员，一起让每次购买更有把握。</view></view>
 <view class="panel"><view class="row"><view class="heading">小组成员</view><navigator class="option" url="/pages/groups/invite?group_id={{group.group_id}}">邀请好友</navigator></view><view wx:for="{{members}}" wx:key="user_id" class="item member"><view class="member-initial">{{item.initial}}</view><view class="member-name">{{item.nickname || '微信用户'}}</view><text wx:if="{{item.user_id === group.creator_id}}" class="badge">创建者</text></view></view>
 <view class="panel"><navigator class="row item" url="/pages/groups/submit?group_id={{group.group_id}}"><text>提交消费申请</text><text>选择申请 →</text></navigator><navigator class="row item" url="/pages/groups/todos?group_id={{group.group_id}}"><text>小组待办</text><text>查看 →</text></navigator></view><view class="panel stack"><view class="heading">如何共同审批</view><view>提交申请时锁定除申请人外的现有成员，所有人同意后申请通过。</view><view class="muted">之后加入的成员不会获得旧申请的审批资格。每笔申请只绑定一个小组，提交后不能更换审批名单。</view></view></block>
</view>
